  message: "objc half shipped in PR #759 (dev 7b9938a030): a lowercase receiver the body declares (`T *x` local, `(T *)x` parameter) carries `T` in the module slot, dst_ref and receiver_type_hint; project classes hint-only; `id` stays untyped. Measured (higob_swiftobjc_09032026/): churn AFNetworking 459 gains / SDWebImage 816, 0 losses, 0 re-keys; no-module bucket 1306→928 and 2375→1807; io AFNetworking 7→15, SDWebImage 5→8, 0 lost. Still owed by this item: the return-type registry consumer for swift AND objc (a local bound to a message/method result — `[[NSURLSession alloc] init]`-style two-step sends and `-(T *)make` returns — is untyped), and the per-binding-form fixtures + L4 once the corpus grows."  # 7f17
